Notebook[{
Cell[TextData[{
  "Week 3   Projective Geometry",
  StyleBox["\nHomogeneous coordinates",
    FontSize->18]
}], "Title"],

Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Copyright] Dana Scott 1993/1997/1998",
    FontSize->18,
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox["\n\nNotebook  last edited: ",
    FontSize->18],
  StyleBox["11 September 1998",
    FontSize->18,
    FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Subsubtitle"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Homogeneous Coordinates for Points and Lines", "Section"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Projecting points and lines", "Subsection",
  Evaluatable->False,
  AspectRatioFixed->False],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["An example of a projection between planes", "Subsubsection"],

Cell[TextData[{
  "In 3D space let us consider the two planes ",
  StyleBox["z==0", "InlineInput",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  StyleBox[" ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "(",
  StyleBox["i.e.",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  ", the ",
  StyleBox["x,y",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "-plane) and ",
  StyleBox["x==0", "InlineInput"],
  StyleBox[" ",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "(",
  StyleBox["i.e.",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  ", the ",
  StyleBox["y,z",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "-plane).  These two (coordinate) planes are ",
  StyleBox["orthogonal",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " to each other, and they pass through the origin ",
  StyleBox["{0,0,0}", "InlineInput"],
  StyleBox[".",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  " "
}], "Text"],

Cell[TextData[{
  "Using the point ",
  StyleBox["P=={1,1,1}", "InlineInput"],
  " (which does not lie on either of the two planes) as the ",
  StyleBox["center",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " of a projection, we wish to find the formula for the ",
  StyleBox["transformation",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " that maps the \"ground\" plane ",
  StyleBox["z==0", "InlineInput",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  " to the \"canvas\" plane ",
  StyleBox["x==0", "InlineInput"],
  "."
}], "Text"],

Cell[TextData[{
  "In ",
  StyleBox["cross-section",
    FontWeight->"Bold",
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
  " along the ",
  StyleBox["x",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "- and ",
  StyleBox["z",
    FontWeight->"Bold"],
  "-axes, the projection looks like this:"
}], "Text"],

Cell[GraphicsData["PostScript", "\<\
